{"3560690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astro Fighters", "steam_appid": 3560690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Astro Fighters is a fast-paced vertical scrolling STG focused on score attack, aggressive grazing, and arcade-style mastery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive dense bullet patterns, collect medals to build your score multiplier, and charge your graze gauge by flying dangerously close to enemy fire. Spend stored energy strategically to unleash powerful spread attacks, trigger screen-clearing bombs, or slow time itself to escape impossible situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both casual survival play and hardcore 1CC score chasing, Astro Fighters rewards precision, routing, and risk-reward decision making across multiple difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560690/extras/8ff82c8debdaaefef710e1db30b04913.poster.avif?t=1779695909\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560690/extras/8ff82c8debdaaefef710e1db30b04913.webm?t=1779695909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560690/extras/8ff82c8debdaaefef710e1db30b04913.mp4?t=1779695909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive graze system that rewards dangerous close-range play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect medals and maintain score chains for maximum point potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use graze energy for bombs, spread attacks, or spend points on time-slowing survival mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four arcade difficulty modes with unique scoring opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards for every difficulty setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated Gauntlet Mode for endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op and Steam Remote Play Together support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic arcade-inspired vertical shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss encounters filled with dense bullet patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for both survival-focused players and dedicated score chasers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score Attack Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Fighters is designed around arcade score mastery and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mechanic feeds into the scoring system:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain medal chains to maximize point gains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graze enemy bullets at close range to build resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance offensive power against defensive survival tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize routes and enemy clears for leaderboard efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push higher difficulties for greater score rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival alone is only the beginning. True mastery comes from learning enemy waves, perfecting routes, and maximizing score potential under relentless pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a balance between survival and greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you spend graze energy defensively to survive a difficult boss pattern, or save it to maximize score potential later in the run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulties offer greater scoring rewards, denser enemy patterns, and increasingly demanding routing strategies for players chasing leaderboard dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560690/extras/05fa2b2c1025257120a59bb56b9d4688.poster.avif?t=1779695909\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560690/extras/05fa2b2c1025257120a59bb56b9d4688.webm?t=1779695909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560690/extras/05fa2b2c1025257120a59bb56b9d4688.mp4?t=1779695909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Fighters is inspired by classic arcade STGs and modern bullet hell score attack design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn enemy waves, optimize routes, master grazing patterns, and push for the perfect run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Achieve the 1CC?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on increasingly brutal stages, massive bosses, and relentless bullet storms in a game designed to reward practice, precision, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing your first clear or competing for leaderboard placement, Astro Fighters offers a deeply replayable arcade challenge for shmup fans.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Astro Fighters is a fast-paced vertical scrolling STG focused on score attack, aggressive grazing, and arcade-style mastery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive dense bullet patterns, collect medals to build your score multiplier, and charge your graze gauge by flying dangerously close to enemy fire. Spend stored energy strategically to unleash powerful spread attacks, trigger screen-clearing bombs, or slow time itself to escape impossible situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both casual survival play and ha